  "body": "I'm currently trying to get a read response from a serial device, and as far as I can tell there is no clear way to do it. I have tried writing and then await a response, but it seems that the timing has to be perfect or the returned bytes will not appear in the read stream. Is there something I'm missing in how to consistently get a response from a write?",
